{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791969360, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T09:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T09:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791969420, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56627, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "敦化南路從基隆路一路到信義路段的紅綠燈連貫性不順，除了時間成本也延伸空汙等，期待市長改善讓開車順起來", "display_name": "大安代表 No.56,627", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "經濟", "content": "南港說要變東區門戶，結果除了辦公大樓什麼都沒有，晚上像空城。", "display_name": "南港代表 No.23", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 62013, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "騎摩托車遇到行人闖紅燈，叭了還被罵", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.62,013", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46975, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望不止把樹種回來，還要加倍的種樹！", "display_name": "南港代表 No.46,975", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:36+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41513, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "很多的巷弄非常窄（寬不足8公尺）允許雙向通行但已經會車不便了，但路的兩邊還允許停汽機車。非常難通行！", "display_name": "文山代表 Joyce Tseng", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:16:51+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12071, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "體育", "content": "好期待運動驛站！！能不能再加上新北市捷運周邊一起串聯？", "display_name": "文山代表 吳志峯 Isas", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_n